      "text": "(d) Crash Tracking: Contractors shall report to the contracting agency regarding any crash resulting in bodily injury, fatality, major vehicle damage (over $1,000), or property damage to a City facility involving a City-contracted vehicle occurring during the performance of a contract involving such vehicle. The City may restrict individual drivers with a record of unsafe driving from operation of city-contracted vehicles, subject to appropriate safeguards and applicable law.",
